  "description": "A .NET Framework 4.8 REST API library for accessing OSIsoft PI System data. Provides comprehensive AF SDK functionality including data retrieval, write operations, event frames, analyses, templates, and calculations through a modern Web API interface.",
  "id": "PIWebAPI",
